{"id": "EUVD-2026-98001", "enisaUuid": "8baeec6a-90b2-3a8a-aee6-d06a2320fb65", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.112.0 and 16.x before 16.23.0 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability because a tool view interpolates stored record names into markup without escaping. An authenticated user able to create such records can give them malicious names, executing script in the session of any user who later opens that tool.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:21:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:13:29", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-734c-hv9r-mg2c", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/erpnext-before-15.112.0-stored-xss-via-tool-view-record-names"], "aliases": ["GHSA-frw3-f8vj-wxg9", "CVE-2026-109604"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "bf7eda66-b0ef-328f-aa5e-183ed885a7fc", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.112.0"}, {"id": "f41a9fa2-c334-31d3-9bc5-1391f25f11f3", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.23.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cc41beca-58bb-3c34-84a6-10f2f6db0434", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}